                    {
                        "form_id": "0ecea782-170a-426a-8b7f-c37686bd9f83",
                        "entry_id": "68c96ad1-f59f-302e-9546-66b55ed3e8e8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "потаску́шках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "747bb3f2-76eb-38b4-a739-d5ba20ba6f64",
                        "entry_id": "68c96ad1-f59f-302e-9546-66b55ed3e8e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост., презр. уменьш. к потаскуха; женщина, ведущая безнравственный образ жизни"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e826b32-837c-44ff-b55f-78ecc495524f",
                                "sense_id": "747bb3f2-76eb-38b4-a739-d5ba20ba6f64",
                                "text": "Да ведь кто? Так, потаскушка какая-нибудь, бесстыжая. Зашлюндает подол ― да и мечется зря…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88de7673-b970-4746-944e-a22d0d7a8857",
                                "sense_id": "747bb3f2-76eb-38b4-a739-d5ba20ba6f64",
                                "text": "А кроме того, мне было ясно, что девочка, моя девочка, зная, что он смотрит на неё, наслаждается его похотливым взглядом и напоказ для него скачет и веселится, ― мерзкая, обожаемая потаскушка!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb88b13f-10f9-4e66-b276-c26159437ac6",
                        "source_entry_id": "68c96ad1-f59f-302e-9546-66b55ed3e8e8",
                        "source_sense_id": "747bb3f2-76eb-38b4-a739-d5ba20ba6f64",
                        "target_lang_word": "strumpet",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "strumpet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c97e064-2c6d-313e-b369-f2ffe8ade40e",
                                        "entry_id": "a1c4e905-98ea-32ab-89f2-8af02b419251",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female prostitute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6883a67e-3aff-4020-ac81-57d9bc57b652",
                                                "sense_id": "5c97e064-2c6d-313e-b369-f2ffe8ade40e",
                                                "text": "Em[ilia]. Fie, fie vpon thee ſtrumpet. / Bian[ca]. I am no ſtrumpet, but of life as honeſt, / As you, that thus abuſe me. / Em[ilia]. As I: fough, fie vpon thee."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f922a93-d203-3dff-9be4-f1297f35ba43",
                                        "entry_id": "a1c4e905-98ea-32ab-89f2-8af02b419251",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woman who is very sexually active."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1dc28094-8e70-3a4d-adff-699792f06f01",
                                        "entry_id": "a1c4e905-98ea-32ab-89f2-8af02b419251",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female adulterer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59f9e55b-245f-30d1-a1d6-d52d533f19e6",
                                        "entry_id": "a1c4e905-98ea-32ab-89f2-8af02b419251",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mistress."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea26ed0a-3372-356b-8c9c-c32aaa7dac65",
                                        "entry_id": "a1c4e905-98ea-32ab-89f2-8af02b419251",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trollop; a whore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1320b0f-119d-4f36-ba9a-dad6114f150c",
                                                "sense_id": "ea26ed0a-3372-356b-8c9c-c32aaa7dac65",
                                                "text": "He cals her on a ſudden, all to naught; ſhe is a ſtrumpet, a light huswife, a bitch, an arrant whore."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9ecea65-e643-440d-9798-660355f32eb8",
                                                "sense_id": "ea26ed0a-3372-356b-8c9c-c32aaa7dac65",
                                                "text": "We have legalized the strumpet and are guarding her retreat; Greed is seeking out commercial souls before his judgement seat; O, be swift, ye clods, to answer him! be jubilant my feet! Our god is marching on!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cb120bf-4eca-49ee-9f38-f9afacd6fbcf",
                                                "sense_id": "ea26ed0a-3372-356b-8c9c-c32aaa7dac65",
                                                "text": "However, terrible as it may seem to the tall maiden sisters of J.P.'s in Queen Anne houses with walled vegetable gardens, this courtesan, strumpet, harlot, whore, punk, fille de joie, street-walker, this trollop, this trull, this baggage, this hussy, this drab, skit, rig, quean, mopsy, demirep, demimondaine, this wanton, this fornicatress, this doxy, this concubine, this frail sister, this poor Queenie--did actually solicit me, did actually say 'coming home to-night, dearie' and my soul was not blasted enough to call a policeman."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "strumpet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "701227a2-62f3-3ef0-af96-c9f16acd8827",
                                        "entry_id": "8924a79c-46fa-347e-ba4e-b792bdc44300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To debauch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07a6f6fb-0941-4820-bbb8-fc0d156008ff",
                                                "sense_id": "701227a2-62f3-3ef0-af96-c9f16acd8827",
                                                "text": "My blood is mingled with the crime of lust; / For if we two be one, and thou play false, / I do digest the poison of thy flesh, / Being strumpeted by thy contagion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88f87272-5db4-3973-8ac4-de628bb18fd5",
                                        "entry_id": "8924a79c-46fa-347e-ba4e-b792bdc44300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To dishonour with the reputation of being a strumpet; to belie; to slander."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f96e24f-7385-43bf-958a-3860f614f872",
                                                "sense_id": "88f87272-5db4-3973-8ac4-de628bb18fd5",
                                                "text": "That proud man, that vvas / Deny'd the honour of your bed, yet durſt / VVith his untrue reports, ſtrumpet your fame, / Compell'd by mee, hath given himſelfe the lye, / And in his ovvne blood vvrote it, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a496e33-e24e-4e26-a87c-24b530823415",
                        "source_entry_id": "68c96ad1-f59f-302e-9546-66b55ed3e8e8",
                        "source_sense_id": "747bb3f2-76eb-38b4-a739-d5ba20ba6f64",
                        "target_lang_word": "trollop",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trollop",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75db9ac0-ccc0-37d8-b3f9-273ce2263dc4",
                                        "entry_id": "b0f22587-7ea7-3825-abcd-7cc4814d3cfb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A strumpet; a whore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "313e511b-fc48-4b57-87ea-cedcec0014c9",
                                                "sense_id": "75db9ac0-ccc0-37d8-b3f9-273ce2263dc4",
                                                "text": "Many an unfortunate Tuppenny trollop has gone from the old hag's den to the special ward at Little Bay, but not before the fell disease of the harlotic slums has been spread broadcast among the reckless patrons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "032ca6f5-95e6-4041-8ea0-e32f759d3765",
                                                "sense_id": "75db9ac0-ccc0-37d8-b3f9-273ce2263dc4",
                                                "text": "However, terrible as it may seem to the tall maiden sisters of J.P.'s in Queen Anne houses with walled vegetable gardens, this courtesan, strumpet, harlot, whore, punk, fille de joie, street-walker, this trollop, this trull, this baggage, this hussy, this drab, skit, rig, quean, mopsy, demirep, demimondaine, this wanton, this fornicatress, this doxy, this concubine, this frail sister, this poor Queenie--did actually solicit me, did actually say 'coming home to-night, dearie' and my soul was not blasted enough to call a policeman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62836572-0647-4f96-88e5-1b39f883e87b",
                                                "sense_id": "75db9ac0-ccc0-37d8-b3f9-273ce2263dc4",
                                                "text": "Aarfy's buxom trollop had vanished with her smutty cameo ring, and Nurse Duckett was ashamed of him because he had refused to fly more combat missions and would cause a scandal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "trollop",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
